  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Works Experimental Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Works Experimental Activity that seeks to improve the land rights of peri-urban land holders for the realization of social, political and economic rights by conducting a research and testing interventions that will potentially improve land administration and management, and land titling processes and, increase access to information on land administration and management for citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
